Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Wiki|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Wiki|
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
		|portletName|Wiki|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Wiki Test Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Activate Initial Staging With Wiki Attachment
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteType|Blank|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Staging Test Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiPage add PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage add Attachment Via Page Edit
		|attachmentFileName|Document_1.jpg|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|uncheckContent|Wiki|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage view Attachment PG Via Edit
		|attachmentFileName|Document_1.jpg|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	Then WikiPage view Attachment PG Via Edit
		|attachmentFileName|Document_1.jpg|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
Scenario: Configure Portlet Display Settings
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	When Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And WikiPortlet view Configuration Tabs
		|isNotPresent|NAVIGATION_EMAIL_FROM,NAVIGATION_PAGE_ADDED_EMAIL,NAVIGATION_PAGE_UPDATED_EMAIL,NAVIGATION_RSS|
		|isPresent|SETUP_DISPLAY_SETTINGS_PANEL|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiPortlet goto Configuration
	And WikiPortlet view Configuration Tabs
		|isNotPresent|SETUP_DISPLAY_SETTINGS|
		|isPresent|NAVIGATION_EMAIL_FROM,NAVIGATION_PAGE_ADDED_EMAIL,NAVIGATION_PAGE_UPDATED_EMAIL,NAVIGATION_RSS|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And WikiPortlet configure Display Settings
		|uncheckSetting|ENABLE_COMMENTS,ENABLE_COMMENT_RATINGS,ENABLE_PAGE_RATINGS,ENABLE_RELATED_ASSETS|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	Then WikiPortlet view Display Settings
		|uncheckedSetting|ENABLE_COMMENTS,ENABLE_COMMENT_RATINGS,ENABLE_PAGE_RATINGS,ENABLE_RELATED_ASSETS|
