Scenario: Search Wiki Comments And Attachments
Priority: 4
	Given WikiPage add Front Page PG
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiPage add Attachment Via Page Edit
		|attachmentFileName|Document_1.txt|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiPage add Child Page PG
		|wikiChildPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Content|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	And WikiPage add Comment
		|entryComment|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Comment Body document|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiPage search PG
		|searchTerm|document|
	And WikiPage view Search Results PG
		|commentBody|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Comment Body document|
		|wikiComment|true|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	Then WikiPage view Search Results PG
		|wikiAttachment|true|
		|wikiAttachmentBody|This is a *.txt document.|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
Scenario: View No Wiki XS Svia Add Page
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	When WikiPage edit Front Page PG
		|wikiPageContentEdit||
	And AssertClick the value 'Edit' at locator 'Link#EDIT'
	Then AssertAlertNotPresent
Scenario: View Wiki Draft Pages Via Breadcrumb
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And AssertClick the value 'Recent Changes' at locator 'WikiTable#NAVIGATION_RECENT_CHANGES'
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Wiki Test Page|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Recent Changes|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	And AssertClick the value 'All Pages' at locator 'WikiTable#NAVIGATION_ALL_PAGES'
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Wiki Test Page|
		|pathLocator|CURRENT_LOCATION|
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|All Pages|
		|pathLocator|CURRENT_LOCATION|
	And AssertClick the value 'Draft Pages' at locator 'WikiTable#NAVIGATION_DRAFT_PAGES'
	And Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Wiki Test Page|
		|pathLocator|PAGE|
	Then Breadcrumb view PG
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Draft Pages|
		|pathLocator|CURRENT_LOCATION|

